   "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
   "text": "Each thread does 2.3 us of work and costs about 100 times that to exist.\n99% of the run is spent on threads, 1% on the matrix. Fewer threads, each doing many cells, removes the gray.",
   "originalText": "Each thread does 2.3 us of work and costs about 100 times that to exist.\n99% of the run is spent on threads, 1% on the matrix. Fewer threads, each doing many cells, removes the gray.",
